    "# KonkaniVani ASR Fine-Tuning - 100GB Dataset with Streaming\n",
    "## Fine-tune best_model (1).pt with large dataset support\n",
    "\n",
    "### Setup Instructions:\n",
    "1. Upload `best_model (1).pt` as Kaggle Dataset\n",
    "2. Upload your 100GB dataset (or link to existing Kaggle dataset)\n",
    "3. Enable GPU (T4 or P100)\n",
    "4. Run all cells\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Features:\n",
    "- Streaming data loader (no need to load full 100GB into memory)\n",
    "- Lower learning rate for fine-tuning\n",
    "- Data augmentation (SpecAugment)\n",
    "- WER monitoring every epoch\n",
    "- Automatic checkpointing"
   ]
